@startuml
title Laboratorio CI/CD - Secuencia (Jenkins -> Build -> Nexus -> Deploy -> Smoke)

'--- Estilo (opcional, pero ayuda mucho a leer)
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2C3E50
  LifeLineBorderColor #95A5A6
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #34495E
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  BoxBorderColor #34495E
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8F9F9
  GroupBorderColor #BDC3C7
  GroupBackgroundColor #FBFCFC
}

actor Dev as "Developer"
participant "Git (local)" as GitLocal
participant "GitHub (remote repo)" as GitHub
participant "Jenkins Controller" as Jenkins
participant "Jenkins Agent\n(agent-maven-2)" as Agent
participant "Maven" as Maven
database "Maven Central" as Central
participant "Nexus\n(Maven Repo + Docker Registry)\nlocalhost:8082" as Nexus <<node>>
participant "Docker Engine" as Docker
participant "Docker Compose" as Compose
participant "DESA Host\n(/deploy/desa)" as DesaHost <<host>>
participant "Container: hola-mundo-desa\n(Spring Boot)" as AppCtn <<container>>
database "Container: pg-desa\n(PostgreSQL 16)" as PgCtn <<container>>

note over Dev,GitHub
Repositorio: app + Jenkinsfile + docker-compose.yml
Estrategia: build inmutable (tag por commit)
end note

== 1) Commit & Trigger ==
Dev -> GitLocal : commit
Dev -> GitLocal : git push
GitLocal -> GitHub : git push (SSH)

opt Webhook / Poll SCM
GitHub -> Jenkins : notify / Jenkins detecta cambio
end opt

== 2) Orquestación Jenkins ==
Dev -> Jenkins : Run pipeline (ENV=desa)
activate Jenkins
Jenkins -> Agent : schedule job on agent
activate Agent

note right of Agent
Workspace limpio
Variables típicas:
- GIT_COMMIT
- APP_VERSION / IMAGE_TAG
- ENV=desa
end note

== 3) Checkout ==
Agent -> GitHub : git fetch / checkout main@<commit>
GitHub --> Agent : código fuente

== 4) Build Maven ==
group Build + Unit tests
Agent -> Maven : mvn -B clean test package
activate Maven
Maven -> Central : resolve dependencias
Central --> Maven : jars/poms
Maven --> Agent : target/app.jar
deactivate Maven
end group

note right of Agent
Artefacto generado:
- target/app.jar
end note

== 5) Publicación a Nexus (Maven) ==
opt Publicar artefacto (si aplica)
Agent -> Nexus : mvn deploy (repo releases/snapshots)
Nexus --> Agent : 201 Created / OK
end opt

== 6) Build & Push imagen Docker ==
group Imagen Docker (tag inmutable)
Agent -> Docker : docker build -t nexus/app:${IMAGE_TAG} .
Docker --> Agent : imagen creada
Agent -> Nexus : docker login (credenciales Jenkins)
Nexus --> Agent : login ok
Agent -> Nexus : docker push nexus/app:${IMAGE_TAG}
Nexus --> Agent : push ok (digest sha256:...)
end group

note over Agent,Nexus
Buenas prácticas:
- Tag: commit corto (ej. 82725b6)
- Opcional: "latest" solo para dev
end note

== 7) Deploy en DESA (Compose) ==
group Despliegue
Agent -> DesaHost : ssh: cd /deploy/desa
Agent -> Compose : docker compose pull
Compose -> Nexus : pull nexus/app:${IMAGE_TAG}
Nexus --> Compose : layers ok
Compose -> Docker : docker compose up -d
Docker --> Compose : contenedores (re)creados
end group

note right of Compose
docker-compose.yml referencia:
image: nexus/app:${IMAGE_TAG}
Variables por ENV (desa):
- DB_URL
- DB_USER/PASS (secrets)
end note

== 8) Arranque + DB ==
Docker -> PgCtn : start postgres
Docker -> AppCtn : start java -jar app.jar
AppCtn -> PgCtn : JDBC connect
AppCtn -> PgCtn : Flyway migrate

alt Migración OK
PgCtn --> AppCtn : OK
else Migración falla
PgCtn --> AppCtn : error
note right of AppCtn
Síntoma típico:
- crash / restart loop
- logs con SQL error
end note
end alt

== 9) Smoke test ==
group Verificación
Agent -> Docker : docker exec app wget -qO- http://localhost:8080/health
Docker -> AppCtn : HTTP GET /health
AppCtn --> Docker : 200 OK
Docker --> Agent : salida OK
end group

alt Smoke OK
Agent --> Jenkins : SUCCESS
else Smoke falla
Agent --> Jenkins : FAILURE
group Rollback (opcional)
Agent -> Compose : docker compose down
note right of Compose
Rollback por etiqueta anterior:
IMAGE_TAG=prev
docker compose up -d
end note
end group
end alt

deactivate Agent
deactivate Jenkins

@enduml
